EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT k, count(*), sum(n) FROM ah GROUP BY k ORDER BY 3 DESC, 1;
                        QUERY PLAN                         
-----------------------------------------------------------
 Gather Merge
   Workers Planned: 2
   ->  Vec Sort
         Sort Key: (sum(n)) DESC, k
         ->  Vec Finalize HashAggregate
               Group Key: k
               ->  Parallel Vec Repartition
                     Partition Key: k
                     ->  Vec Partial HashAggregate
                           Group Key: k
                           ->  Parallel Vec Seq Scan on ah
